{"reviewer": "assistant_visual_inspection", "independent_manual_ground_truth": false, "scope": "Current original pixels and overlays reviewed at displayed resolution; no quantitative accuracy claim", "entries": [{"id": "dual_20260923_113745__left", "frame": 50, "artifact": "visual_count_probes/dual_20260923_113745__left_000050.jpg", "findings": "诊断列区间内 8 个交点；未发现明显重复或漏行；中心距 8.68 节距与交点条数含义不同。", "calibration": "diagnostic_only"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_101517__right", "frame": 140, "artifact": "visual_count_probes/dual_20260923_101517__right_000140.jpg", "findings": "诊断列区间内 18 个交点排列与可见绳纹相符；边界端点及活动绳端点仍包含模型误差。", "calibration": "diagnostic_only"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113305__right", "frame": 80, "artifact": "visual_count_probes/dual_20260923_113305__right_000080.jpg", "findings": "诊断列区间内 17 个交点，未见明显跳过整行或重复行。", "calibration": "diagnostic_only"}, {"id": "dual_20260924_111143__right", "frame": 80, "artifact": "visual_count_probes/dual_20260924_111143__right_000080.jpg", "findings": "诊断列区间内 2 个交点；可见接近但尚有间距。", "calibration": "diagnostic_only"}, {"id": "dual_20260924_111143__right", "frame": 140, "artifact": "visual_count_probes/dual_20260924_111143__right_000140.jpg", "findings": "活动绳已接近黄色法兰与卷面的交界，间隙窄，当前画面不能独立确认实体接触；近边不确定状态合理。", "calibration": "current_local_tangency_diagnostic"}, {"id": "dual_20260924_111143__right", "frame": 180, "artifact": "visual_count_probes/dual_20260924_111143__right_000180.jpg", "findings": "活动绳/边界投影重叠，右下出现工具遮挡，负的投影差不能解释为负根数；近边不确定状态合理。", "calibration": "current_local_tangency_diagnostic"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113745__left", "frame": 370, "artifact": "layout_preview_370.jpg", "findings": "ROI21 恢复右侧可见卷面 F3 曲线；工具遮挡附近的边界使用蓝虚线估计，不能据此确认实体接触。此图使用诊断 d=2100，并非最终标定。", "calibration": "diagnostic_only"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113029__right", "frame": 500, "artifact": "right_113029_500.jpg", "findings": "进绳仅出现在画面下方，入卷弯折/计数端点在图像外。无法通过降低阈值恢复缺失的图像信息。", "calibration": "not_identifiable"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113029__left", "frame": 306, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_113029__left/review/000306.jpg", "findings": "黄色法兰碎片合并和当前宽范围凸曲线恢复后，计数列覆盖真实卷面。可见 19 条区间内绳沟，拟合曲线与图上绳纹相符；未见明显重复类别。模型中心距约 18.77 圈，非独立真值。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113029__left", "frame": 41, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_113029__left/review/000041.jpg", "findings": "原失败 ROI 仅保留左侧半幅卷面。扩大当前侧面黄色碎片的提议范围后恢复完整计数区域，图中 11 条绳沟与可见排列一致；约 10.81 圈为当前条件估计。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113745__left", "frame": 248, "artifact": "candidate_dual_20260923_113745__left_000248.jpg", "findings": "新 CE4 当前绳体轴沿可见活动绳，计数区间有约 3 条沟槽；约 2.82 圈与图像几何一致。旧轴只是上游外推，不适合作为否决新身份的真值。采用经当前证据核验的候选。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113745__left", "frame": 405, "artifact": "candidate_dual_20260923_113745__left_000405.jpg", "findings": "工具遮挡且候选仍需长距离上游直线外推；黄色线在绳转弯区域的投影不能证明真实入卷位置。该候选未进入交付计数，保留当前证据不足状态。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_101517__right", "frame": 580, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_101517__right/review/000580.jpg", "findings": "当前活动绳已近可见卷面界限；首几条沟槽无法独立构成完整相位链。近边不确定状态与图像相符，没有把中心距约 1.14 圈当成实体接触证据。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_101643__right", "frame": 570, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_101643__right/review/000570.jpg", "findings": "活动绳明显远离上侧边界，输出大于五圈合理。图中计数段检测 29 条沟槽，但存在缺口，显示明确为几何估计；未把该结果当作精确整数真值。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113745__left", "frame": 310, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_113745__left/review/000310.jpg", "findings": "31 秒已恢复当前绳轴和 F3 计数，图中约一条绳沟位于两端点之间，显示约 1.4 圈及模型范围。该处不再因可见边界横向范围限制而整列丢失。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113745__left", "frame": 370, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_113745__left/review/000370.jpg", "findings": "37 秒工具覆盖接近位置，仍有下方当前 F3 沟槽。被遮挡的边界用蓝虚线，显示约 0.3 圈同时给出跨零且较宽的范围，贴边状态为不确定；不能从此帧确认实体接触。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113745__left", "frame": 397, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_113745__left/review/000397.jpg", "findings": "换向附近工具遮挡，活动绳投影在边界模型上方，不能把负中心距改成零圈。投影冲突提示与图像一致；该段不是实体接触确认。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260923_113305__right", "frame": 580, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260923_113305__right/review/000580.jpg", "findings": "原图上活动绳与卷面边界接近；当前区间内一条沟槽，输出约 1.4 圈及跨较宽范围的误差。工具在更低处，未被计为活动绳。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260924_111143__right", "frame": 140, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260924_111143__right/review/000140.jpg", "findings": "该阶段开始时已经近边，缺少满足最终五圈约束的参考帧；固定 d 保持未标定。白色诊断列仅用于当前局部近边观察，画面确实近边，但没有给固定列根数。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260924_111143__right", "frame": 180, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260924_111143__right/review/000180.jpg", "findings": "工具和活动绳接近边界，蓝虚线为遮挡后的模型范围。输出跨零的较宽区间及近边不确定，没有确认实体接触。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}, {"id": "dual_20260924_111500__left", "frame": 300, "artifact": "delivery/dual_20260924_111500__left/review/000300.jpg", "findings": "活动绳在边界附近，卷面沟槽在下方清楚可见，端点处仍受活动绳自身遮挡及曲线模型偏差影响。约 1.1 圈的范围跨零，保持近边不确定，不能确认实体贴边。", "calibration": "final_conditional_geometry_estimate", "review_type": "assistant_visual_inspection_not_independent_truth"}]}